{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Make shine</b> — the word על is like אל, as in ותתפלל על ה' (and she prayed to YHWH). Like יאר ה' פניו (YHWH make His face shine), for he is in distress as one sitting in darkness; therefore, shine."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:05.969472230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}